{
  "packet_version": "document-consolidation-input-v1.0",
  "technical_document_id": "BATCH05-DOC05",
  "document_id": "15.陈海峰（三访）20110816（一校后 阅读版）.docx",
  "interviewee": "陈海峰",
  "source_model_id": "cuc/deepseek",
  "source_prompt_version": "system-v0.3-frozen+window-v0.5",
  "task_scope": "归并同一文档的窗口候选，并区分个人经历、讲述背景和范围不确定项。",
  "dialogue_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0003",
      "segment_order": 3,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：那么我们要配合部队，一个人啊，交20个，至少要交10个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0004",
      "segment_order": 4,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "就是用稻草编起来，搓那个草绳，编成个草垫子。草垫子铺上泥巴，一层泥巴放一个草垫子，再铺上一些泥巴，再铺草垫子，三层到四层，把它卷起来，再用麻绳呢捆起来，一个稻草卷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0005",
      "segment_order": 5,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "稻草卷再喷上水，水呢现在不喷，（重量）比较轻一点。那么我们挖这个战壕，这个土坦克呢，就一个一个排好队。这个不露面，上面看不到，一直挖到河边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0007",
      "segment_order": 7,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：到傍晚呢，天快黑了，（进攻）开始了，把这个土坦克一卷一卷喷上水，把力气大的，机枪手啊、迫击炮手啊……迫击炮手都是一扛50斤啊，迫击炮那个炮筒是50斤重啊，重机枪手啊，轻机枪手啊，（那都是）到那彪形大汉，吃饭一顿都要吃一斤啊，都是长袍（音）罗汉，他那个力气大。两个人三个人四个人，把它一推，（稻草卷）它就从岸上边滚到河里面去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0009",
      "segment_order": 9,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：沿着这个坡度啊，它就滚下去了。上面再第二个、第三个、第四个、第五个，从河底下往上垫，垫到水面上。垫上"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0010",
      "segment_order": 10,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "这个草包以后呢，就说在草包上面，再用草包往前面填。敌人如果发现了，我们用机枪封锁他那个枪眼洞，压他火力，我们集中往前。用这个土办法把这条河填满。人是突击队啊，就从草包这个上面啊，过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0012",
      "segment_order": 12,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：等于架了一个桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0013",
      "segment_order": 13,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：那得多少（草包）？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0014",
      "segment_order": 14,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：哎呦，几百个草包啊，铺一条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0015",
      "segment_order": 15,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：水流不（会）把它冲走吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0016",
      "segment_order": 16,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：不是。那个河，小河浜它都围着那个庙的周围啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0017",
      "segment_order": 17,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "他那个碉堡周围啊，水是不流动的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0018",
      "segment_order": 18,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "所以这样子填满，我们叫它土坦克，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0019",
      "segment_order": 19,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "我没看到过有材料介绍过这东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0020",
      "segment_order": 20,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这个办法还没听说过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0021",
      "segment_order": 21,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：我们老一团用的，所以把北寺这个碉堡都解决了。开始伤亡很大，上去一个连，一家伙就没有了，上去一个排，一家伙就（被）全部消灭光了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0022",
      "segment_order": 22,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "敌人轻重机枪“嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎”一扫，你都不行了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0023",
      "segment_order": 23,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "你还没接近到那个碉堡，就完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0024",
      "segment_order": 24,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这个地堡有多少敌人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0026",
      "segment_order": 26,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：南寺、北寺（都）有。我们是打北寺附近的那几个据点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0027",
      "segment_order": 27,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "我们负责四五个据点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0028",
      "segment_order": 28,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "那么还有几个独立团，他一共27个据点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0029",
      "segment_order": 29,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "我们都一个一个包围。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0030",
      "segment_order": 30,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：您刚才提到……"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0031",
      "segment_order": 31,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：我们给北寺打下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0032",
      "segment_order": 32,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：你们刚才提到土坦克打的就是北寺，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0033",
      "segment_order": 33,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：叫北寺战斗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0034",
      "segment_order": 34,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "没有材料记载，没有人写这个材料。我看那个老1团的回忆录里都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0035",
      "segment_order": 35,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "有的人提到一两句，打死了税警团怎么怎么的，就完了。消灭税警团两千多，俘虏他一千多，我们伤亡一千多，就完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0037",
      "segment_order": 37,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：但是他没有像您老这么多细节。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0038",
      "segment_order": 38,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：没有详细（讲）。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0039",
      "segment_order": 39,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "怎么打？怎么伤亡？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0040",
      "segment_order": 40,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "这一部分材料没有人看到。那么我们打得很艰苦，伤亡也很大，代价也很大。打完以后嘛，大概梁王寺也打下来了，青墩后来也打下来了，主要的据点都打下来了。但我们代价很大，主力部队伤亡很大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0041",
      "segment_order": 41,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "打了一个半月，并没有把敌人全部消灭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0042",
      "segment_order": 42,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "为什么打他呢？因为他投降日本鬼子，日本鬼子下了委任令，陈泰运呢，编成伪军集团军。第1集团军是李长江啊，他这个（是）第2集团军，就几个支队啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0044",
      "segment_order": 44,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：后来打他的时候，日本人还救他了，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0045",
      "segment_order": 45,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：后来日本人也来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0046",
      "segment_order": 46,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "日本人来了。我们伤亡很大，就撤回来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0047",
      "segment_order": 47,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "这是（19）44年的9、10月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0048",
      "segment_order": 48,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "打完这个仗以后，我们的老1团就撤到宝应。车桥战役以后，就是《柳堡的故事》那个地方，就是柳堡，柳堡是真地方，那个故事是真的。就是北安丰，北边的安丰，南安丰、西安丰、北安丰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0049",
      "segment_order": 49,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "那么在北安丰、柳堡、固井（音），我们团部驻在固井（音）。我们南下之后，改成教导旅了，我们老1团马上变成旅了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0050",
      "segment_order": 50,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：就是还没到苏南的时候，你们就已经改（成旅了）。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0052",
      "segment_order": 52,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：后来他到苏南，他就变成第4纵队了。4纵队就是这个"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0053",
      "segment_order": 53,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "老1团，老1团的底子变成教导旅，教导旅就变成"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0054",
      "segment_order": 54,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "苏浙军区第4纵队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0055",
      "segment_order": 55,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "苏浙军区这个（四纵队）10支队就是我那个团，老1团的老底子，就是现在河南开封的第20集团军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0056",
      "segment_order": 56,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "20集团军就是苏浙军区的4纵队"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0057",
      "segment_order": 57,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "，就是这个教导旅"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0058",
      "segment_order": 58,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "，就是这个老1团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0059",
      "segment_order": 59,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：嗯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0060",
      "segment_order": 60,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：也就是叶飞的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0061",
      "segment_order": 61,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "老6团两个营（发展来的）。叶飞啊，从3支队带了个团部，带上两个营。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0063",
      "segment_order": 63,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：到了苏南，由谭震林指挥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0064",
      "segment_order": 64,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "谭震林后来去了，成立新江抗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0065",
      "segment_order": 65,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "新江抗就是江南指挥部，叶飞呢，任江南副总指挥，正指挥（是）梅光迪，是江抗3路的那个司令员，后来叛变了，所以历史上不提他。那么参谋长呢，就胡发坚，后来牺牲了。那个政治部主任呢，就是李青，后来就是长春市委书记。这就是叶飞那个部队慢慢发展，就是一个团部两个营。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0067",
      "segment_order": 67,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：以后变成江抗的二路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0068",
      "segment_order": 68,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "二路以后呢，就发展到五千人左右——（江抗）没有一路，二路加上我们三路，以后发展到四路五路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0069",
      "segment_order": 69,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "三路变成江抗2团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0070",
      "segment_order": 70,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "后来叫（江抗）9团。在黄桥决战营溪战斗中间，伤亡很大，我哥哥（是）在那里牺牲的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0071",
      "segment_order": 71,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "以后编成为2旅6团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0072",
      "segment_order": 72,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "以后就变成了2旅5团，2旅5团又变成了48团。所以24军的部队呢，最后是王必成的老2团加上我们江抗部队的三路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0074",
      "segment_order": 74,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：叶飞的部队就发展成第20集团军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0075",
      "segment_order": 75,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "现在（在）开封。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0076",
      "segment_order": 76,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：叶飞部队老底子是江抗二路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0077",
      "segment_order": 77,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：江抗二路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0078",
      "segment_order": 78,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "二路加上这个四路、五路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0079",
      "segment_order": 79,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "以后变成老1团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0080",
      "segment_order": 80,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "再吸收了老2团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0081",
      "segment_order": 81,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "变成主力团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0082",
      "segment_order": 82,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：主力团还叫老1团吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0083",
      "segment_order": 83,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：还叫老1团，2团并进来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0084",
      "segment_order": 84,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "那就变成3500（人）了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0085",
      "segment_order": 85,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：后来南下……"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0086",
      "segment_order": 86,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：教导旅就变成第4纵队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0087",
      "segment_order": 87,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "以后就改编成6纵队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0089",
      "segment_order": 89,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：解放战争就一直叫6纵队，打孟良崮战役叫6纵队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0090",
      "segment_order": 90,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：就在山东了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0091",
      "segment_order": 91,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：就在山东。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0092",
      "segment_order": 92,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "解放以后呢，就改编成第24军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0093",
      "segment_order": 93,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "现在叫24集团军，现在取消（了），24军整个的没有了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0094",
      "segment_order": 94,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "就变成警卫师，所以警卫3师是我的老部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0095",
      "segment_order": 95,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "警卫3师就在顺德（音）的，他们过年不来这？（就是）请我们去吃饭的，这是新四军最老的部队。每年国庆节在前面一个小方块，就是顺德（音）的，警卫3师的部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0096",
      "segment_order": 96,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "部队在前面走的时候，一个小方块。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0097",
      "segment_order": 97,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "也就是过去1支队老2团的基本队伍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0099",
      "segment_order": 99,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：（就是）老红军三年游击战争（下来编成）的1支队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0100",
      "segment_order": 100,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这次之后，你们就该南下了，到苏浙军区了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0101",
      "segment_order": 101,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：那么就讲到我们回到固井（音）以后呢，就是10月份了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0102",
      "segment_order": 102,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "9、10月不是打陈泰运嘛，陈泰运打完了，我们老1团到固井（音）休整。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0103",
      "segment_order": 103,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "休整要改编教导旅，内部已经定了。那么决定南下，中央命令啊，第一次命令啊，要叶飞带两个团，开辟苏浙地区，要准备反攻，要迎接盟军登陆。日本鬼子呢，占领了温州。要苏南部队呢，极力地发展沿海地区。中间沿海地区是空白，都是国民党占领的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0105",
      "segment_order": 105,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：那国民党占领不到的，（是）日本鬼子的，那么我们要沿着海边呢，一直发展到福建边境。所以是从苏南到浙西到浙东到浙南，就是说到福建交界这个地方都要解放，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0106",
      "segment_order": 106,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "要建立根据地，要准备反攻。这个地方呢，就叫苏浙地区。中央第一次命令是要叶飞带两个团下去，后来经过华中局跟1师研究呢，粟裕决定自己带两个主力团下去。而且建议呢，带两个团是不够的，那么多地区要去解放啊，还需要抽调部队，要准备后续部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0108",
      "segment_order": 108,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：先头部队带两个主力团下去，那么这样子中央批准华中的这个计划，粟裕亲自带。那么任命叶飞呢，当苏浙军区副司令，带4纵队做后续部队下去，做些准备工作（再去）。那么江南的16旅改成1纵队，四明山的浙东纵队改成2纵队，3纵队有陶勇的"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0109",
      "segment_order": 109,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "的3旅"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0110",
      "segment_order": 110,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "，7团还给他，他是老7团，老7团就是过去粟裕的老4团，2支队的4团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0112",
      "segment_order": 112,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：2支队3团，“皖南事变”没有了，（被）消灭掉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0113",
      "segment_order": 113,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：3团后来又被调回去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0114",
      "segment_order": 114,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：没有了，调到军部去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0115",
      "segment_order": 115,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：调到军部了，皖南事变……"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0116",
      "segment_order": 116,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：变成新3支队。这个1团呢，调来的傅秋涛，叫新1支队，这皖南事变消灭光了。这个3支队的5团加上3支队的叶飞的这个6团3营，四个营加上支队部的一个特务营，五个营在皖南事变都（被）消灭光了。再加上警卫特务团、军部独立团、军部特务团，一共五个主力团，“皖南事变”全部牺牲了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0117",
      "segment_order": 117,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "都打光了，都不存在了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0119",
      "segment_order": 119,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：那么我们呢，就分批地渡江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0120",
      "segment_order": 120,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：当时是1师的部队全都过去，还是留一部分在江南？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0121",
      "segment_order": 121,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：分批。先头部队呢，是粟裕带。选择这个渡江口啊，原来侦察，在江阴这边渡江。粟裕后来衡量利弊呀，这样的一个部队呀，敌人清乡扫荡刚刚结束啊，这个群众基础越靠南，越靠上海，越不稳定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0122",
      "segment_order": 122,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "这个大部队容易暴露，危险性更大，所以说不同意从镇江以东、以南那个方向过江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0124",
      "segment_order": 124,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：他就选择一条风险最大呢，实际上最安全的地区。要从敌人的鼻子底下过江。就在南京的郊区，龙潭有个火车站。我们乘火车（从）南京到上海，第一站就是龙潭镇啊，有水泥厂的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0125",
      "segment_order": 125,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "就从龙潭镇那里过江。龙潭镇的对江呢，是仪征，就是扬州西面的第一个县。仪征有鬼子，扬州有鬼子，选择（从）鬼子的夹缝里头渡江。龙潭镇一过来以后呢，马上直插到句容，插到茅山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0127",
      "segment_order": 127,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：这里到茅山是最近的，一过龙潭镇啊，就到了句容县了。那句容县就是属于我们苏南根据地了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0128",
      "segment_order": 128,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "就是我们的47团（在那里）。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0129",
      "segment_order": 129,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：那个时候，句容和茅山还有咱们的部队吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0130",
      "segment_order": 130,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：茅山顶上有鬼子啊，。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0131",
      "segment_order": 131,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：但是句容和茅山也有咱们的部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0132",
      "segment_order": 132,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：我们16旅在那。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0133",
      "segment_order": 133,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：谭震林留下的那个部队，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0134",
      "segment_order": 134,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：谭震林留下来（的）部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0135",
      "segment_order": 135,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：那个时候呢，我们过江，王必成已经到了江南了。王必成的2旅啊，带了个4团呢，到江南以后，和46团合并，变成48团。加上江南16旅的47团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0136",
      "segment_order": 136,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：嗯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0137",
      "segment_order": 137,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：江南的47团、46团，47团（是）16旅的，46团并入48团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0139",
      "segment_order": 139,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：那么又变成48团和47团两个团，两个团就编成16旅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0140",
      "segment_order": 140,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这是新的16旅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0141",
      "segment_order": 141,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：新的16旅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0142",
      "segment_order": 142,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "王必成当旅长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0143",
      "segment_order": 143,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "罗、廖牺牲了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0144",
      "segment_order": 144,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "罗忠毅啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0145",
      "segment_order": 145,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "廖海涛牺牲了，（19）41年牺牲了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0146",
      "segment_order": 146,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "那么王必成是提早下去的，（19）42年就下去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0147",
      "segment_order": 147,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "我们这个是（19）44年的事了。那么第一批过江的就是粟裕带老7团，是他的老部队。 "
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0148",
      "segment_order": 148,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：嗯，陶勇的那个……"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0149",
      "segment_order": 149,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：陶勇的部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0150",
      "segment_order": 150,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：陶勇也去了，是吧？ "
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0151",
      "segment_order": 151,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：陶勇没有，陶勇（是）后来成立3纵队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0152",
      "segment_order": 152,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "后来南下的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0153",
      "segment_order": 153,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "打天目山战斗，他才来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0155",
      "segment_order": 155,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：那你们是属于第几批？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0156",
      "segment_order": 156,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：我们是配合第一批，实际上是跟着第一批的后面，基本上是同一天过江的。我们编的叫什么呢？叫练兵司令部。“"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0157",
      "segment_order": 157,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "练习”的“练”。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0158",
      "segment_order": 158,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "我调出来，就到练兵司令部卫生部当医务主任。练兵司令部的卫生部长呢，就是后方医院的副院长，后来当了纵队卫生部（部）长的。（在）6纵队卫生部长当了时间很长的，彭道清，山东人。“彭德怀”的“彭”，“"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0159",
      "segment_order": 159,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "道路”的“道”，“清洁”的“清”。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0160",
      "segment_order": 160,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "我当医务主任，组建练兵司令部的卫生部，我是光杆子去。那么彭道清呢，（从）后方医院带了一些人来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0162",
      "segment_order": 162,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：那么组建这个卫生部。卫生部呢，我们在那边呢，就是休息了大概一个月不到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0163",
      "segment_order": 163,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "那么就是……12月，粟裕是12月26号"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0164",
      "segment_order": 164,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "过的，我们大概也就是27、28（号）就过去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0165",
      "segment_order": 165,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "分两个晚上过去的，第二个晚上还比较危险呢。大部分是第一个晚上过去的。我们走哪里呢？我们走镇江的南边，镇江的郊区。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0167",
      "segment_order": 167,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：丹徒县，我们走扬中，我们走泰州的司马大桥，到了长江边上。摆渡到了三江营，三江营是扬中县的一个小镇。从三江营这个地方插过去，就到了镇江的郊区，丹徒县的大港镇，大港现在有发电站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0168",
      "segment_order": 168,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "大港现在新建了桥，那个时候还没有桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0169",
      "segment_order": 169,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "我们那都摆渡啊，（从）三江营摆渡到大港。大港一上以后呢，马上撤到辛丰，辛丰我们关系比较好，（和）那个伪军啊。我们晚上通过辛丰镇，向漕河，马上插到茅山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0171",
      "segment_order": 171,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这个都是夜里边走的，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0172",
      "segment_order": 172,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：都是晚上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0173",
      "segment_order": 173,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：一个晚上？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0174",
      "segment_order": 174,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：一个晚上突过去，一个晚上要走八十、一百里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0175",
      "segment_order": 175,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：不但要过江，还要走一百里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0176",
      "segment_order": 176,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：走八十、一百里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0177",
      "segment_order": 177,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "那么这样子连续，到了江边休息。休息以后呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0178",
      "segment_order": 178,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "天一黑，一过江。一过江，马上就连续行军，通过好多的封锁线，有江，有公路，有铁路，有运河。哎呀，那个危险很大！苏北的部队啊，都没见过山。哎呀，一过江以后，捡这个石头，爬山（看到石头），哎呀好极了，干粮袋（里）都（放了）捡（的）石头，越背越重，越背越重，山越爬越大，越爬越大。哎呦，他说江南怎么那么多山哪！有的人把大石头扔掉了，捡小石头，小石头扔了，最后留下好玩的小石头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0180",
      "segment_order": 180,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：这个苏北的部队啊，没看到过铁路。看到铁路奇怪得很啊，都（用）手去摸啊，什么玩意。火车来了，一看吓了一跳，前面那个探照灯那么亮，“呜呜”叫那个声音那么大，把他们吓了一跳。那个苏北部队呀，都第一次看到火车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0181",
      "segment_order": 181,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：直接就到茅山了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0182",
      "segment_order": 182,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：到茅山地区，到了溧阳和溧水的交界地方。我们就停下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0184",
      "segment_order": 184,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：大部队就接着向南走，我们就趁机会了解苏南部队的卫生工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH05-DOC05-S0185",
      "segment_order": 185,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    "
    }
  ],
